ction. The algorithm underlying the constraints in parameter space (as well as underlying assumptions) are detailed in [31]. In the results section, we report that the standard DEB model needs particular extensions according to taxonomic group. Each model extension is provided with a unique label and filters were developed for each label. These are presented in the results and discussed in the final section of this study.
