Conclusions
This study represents a large scale application of a general theory for metabolic organization of living organisms: the Dynamic Energy Budget theory. Although DEB theory applies to all organisms, the AmP collection only deals with animals. The reason is that animals eat other organisms, which do not vary much in chemical composition. As a first approximation, their
